  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is:"
  },
